    "title" : "8 Makura Rd, Long Bay - Niseko Real Estate Photographer",
    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730699315327\" id=\"item-67285c59bc85a06dbd3fe204\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-5018ebe0efd95de4913e\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us : </strong>PropertyMedia Japan specialises in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Five Comfortable Bedrooms:</strong> Each bedroom is designed for relaxation, with ample natural light and space for privacy, making it ideal for family members of all ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Two Modern Bathrooms:</strong> The bathrooms feature quality fixtures, modern finishes, and a sleek design, offering a touch of luxury in daily routines.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Open Living Area:</strong> The single, expansive living room is the heart of the home, designed for family gatherings, relaxation, or entertaining. Large windows let in abundant light and frame scenic views of the surrounding area.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Gourmet Kitchen:</strong> This well-appointed kitchen is equipped with high-end appliances, generous storage, and a stylish layout, perfect for meal preparation and hosting with ease.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Single-Car Garage:</strong> The attached garage provides secure parking along with additional storage space for all your needs.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Living and Entertaining:</strong> The landscaped yard and outdoor spaces are perfect for alfresco dining, weekend BBQs, or simply soaking up the tranquility Long Bay offers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Built to combine modern elegance with family-friendly functionality, 8 Makura Rd is a stunning property that delivers the perfect balance of convenience and coastal charm. Enjoy the vibrant Long Bay community with parks, beaches, and amenities close by, making this property an outstanding choice for those seeking an elevated lifestyle. Don\u2019t miss out on this exceptional home in an ideal location.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;67285d2b5dcb0e5b1a5bb2de&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;67285d2b5dcb0e5b1a5bb2de&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730696809221_80467\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-w